    hazards: [['CHEMICAL', 'Acetonitrile and formic acid', 'Volatile and corrosive; work in a fume hood.'], ['TOXIC', 'Iodoacetamide', 'Alkylating agent, light sensitive. Prepare fresh and protect from light.']],
